     A* XDBKWD - keywords that can be used as profile options, per database
     A* type (*ALL = every type). Loaded from xdbkwd.sql; used by WRKXDBPRF
     A* for F4 and for checking. KWVALS: allowed values separated by a
     A* blank, empty = any value.
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R XDBKWDR                   TEXT('XDB option keyword')
     A            KWTYPE        10A         TEXT('Database type or *ALL')
     A                                      COLHDG('Database' 'type')
     A            KWKEY         20A         TEXT('Keyword')
     A                                      COLHDG('Keyword')
     A            KWKIND         1A         TEXT('Kind: C=Connection D=Driver')
     A                                      COLHDG('Kind')
     A            KWTEXT        50A         TEXT('Description')
     A                                      COLHDG('Description')
     A            KWVALS        50A         TEXT('Allowed values')
     A                                      COLHDG('Allowed' 'values')
     A          K KWTYPE                    
     A          K KWKEY                     
